#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:27
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:29
msgid "Returns an array of callsite objects with the following methods:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:31
msgid ""
"`getTypeName`: returns the type of this as a string. This is the name of "
"the function stored in the constructor field of this, if available, "
"otherwise the object's [[Class]] internal property."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:32
msgid ""
"`getFunctionName`: returns the name of the current function, typically "
"its name property. If a name property is not available an attempt will be"
" made to try to infer a name from the function's context."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:33
msgid ""
"`getMethodName`: returns the name of the property of this or one of its "
"prototypes that holds the current function"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:34
msgid ""
"`getFileName`: if this function was defined in a script returns the name "
"of the script"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:35
msgid ""
"`getLineNumber`: if this function was defined in a script returns the "
"current line number"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:36
msgid ""
"`getColumnNumber`: if this function was defined in a script returns the "
"current column number"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:37
msgid ""
"`getEvalOrigin`: if this function was created using a call to eval "
"returns a CallSite object representing the location where eval was called"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:38
msgid ""
"`isToplevel`: is this a top-level invocation, that is, is this the global"
" object?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:39
msgid "`isEval`: does this call take place in code defined by a call to eval?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:40
msgid "`isNative`: is this call in native V8 code?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/callsites_readme.md:41
msgid "`isConstructor`: is this a constructor call?"
msgstr ""

